          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不会。SMB、WebDAV 和 NFS 由系统保持挂载；需要断开时，请在 Kayoi 或 Finder 中推出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不支持": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsupported"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为什么提示没有访问权限？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Why am I getting an access denied message?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为什么提示没有访问权限？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为什么服务地址正确却连不上？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Why can’t I connect with the correct service endpoint?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为什么服务地址正确却连不上？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以下文件操作目前需通过命令行工具 kayoi-dev 使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file operations below currently require the kayoi-dev command-line tool."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下文件操作目前需通过命令行工具 kayoi-dev 使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会先推出这个共享。保存的登录信息会删除，共享里的文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This share will be ejected first. Saved sign-in information will be deleted. Files in the share are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会先推出这个共享。保存的登录信息会删除，共享里的文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会删除 Kayoi 保存的位置和登录信息，设备上的文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The location and sign-in information saved by Kayoi will be deleted. Files on the device are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会删除 Kayoi 保存的位置和登录信息，设备上的文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会删除 Kayoi 保存的登录信息，网盘里的文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign-in information saved by Kayoi will be deleted. Files in the cloud drive are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会删除 Kayoi 保存的登录信息，网盘里的文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Location"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置能力": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Location Capabilities"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置能力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 HTTPS": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use HTTPS"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 HTTPS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用站点的 WebDAV 地址和账户，确保账户拥有相应存储权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the site’s WebDAV address and account. Make sure the account has access to the storage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用站点的 WebDAV 地址和账户，确保账户拥有相应存储权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用能传输数据的数据线，并在手机上允许这台 Mac；无线连接需输入手机当前显示的配对码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use a cable that supports data transfer and allow this Mac on your phone. For a wireless connection, enter the pairing code currently shown on the phone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用能传输数据的数据线，并在手机上允许这台 Mac；无线连接需输入手机当前显示的配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用路径形式访问存储桶": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Path-Style Bucket Access"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用路径形式访问存储桶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用非官方接口，可能随时失效": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses unofficial APIs that may stop working at any time"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用非官方接口，可能随时失效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "修改位置名称和颜色": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change Location Name and Color"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修改位置名称和颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许通知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Notifications"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先在“图像捕捉”中确认 Mac 能识别相机，然后退出图像捕捉，避免同时占用设备。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check that Image Capture recognizes the camera, then quit Image Capture so both apps do not use it at once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先在“图像捕捉”中确认 Mac 能识别相机，然后退出图像捕捉，避免同时占用设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先在服务商或 NAS 中开启 WebDAV。可使用坚果云、Nextcloud、ownCloud、群晖、威联通及 OpenList / AList 等服务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable WebDAV with your provider or on your NAS first. Services include Nutstore, Nextcloud, ownCloud, Synology, QNAP, and OpenList / AList."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先在服务商或 NAS 中开启 WebDAV。可使用坚果云、Nextcloud、ownCloud、群晖、威联通及 OpenList / AList 等服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先在服务商控制台创建存储桶，并准备允许访问该桶的访问密钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a bucket in the provider’s console and prepare an access key that can access it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先在服务商控制台创建存储桶，并准备允许访问该桶的访问密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于 Kayoi": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About Kayoi"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于 Kayoi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其他登录方式…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other Sign-In Methods…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他登录方式…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "准备存储桶、区域和完整服务地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Have your bucket, region, and full service endpoint ready."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "准备存储桶、区域和完整服务地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "准备服务商账号，在服务商自己的登录页面完成授权。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Have your provider account ready and authorize access on the provider’s own sign-in page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "准备服务商账号，在服务商自己的登录页面完成授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分享链接以只读方式打开。清空提取码后保存，会删除之前保存的提取码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share links open as read-only. Clearing the password and saving removes the previously saved share password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分享链接以只读方式打开。清空提取码后保存，会删除之前保存的提取码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分享链接需要使用 HTTPS": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share links must use HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分享链接需要使用 HTTPS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "创建只允许访问目标存储桶的密钥，不要使用主账号密钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a key that can access only the target bucket. Do not use your main account key."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建只允许访问目标存储桶的密钥，不要使用主账号密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发现更新后自动下载安装": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatically download and install updates when available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现更新后自动下载安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取决于设备": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depends on the device"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取决于设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会删除 Kayoi 的本机缓存，设备和网盘中的文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only Kayoi’s local cache will be deleted. Files on devices and cloud drives are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会删除 Kayoi 的本机缓存，设备和网盘中的文件不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只授予需要的读写权限。要上传或整理文件，还需要相应的写入、列出和删除权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grant only the permissions you need. Uploading and organizing files also require the relevant write, list, and delete permissions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只授予需要的读写权限。要上传或整理文件，还需要相应的写入、列出和删除权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以从浏览器复制当前网盘的登录信息并粘贴到这里。不要把它发给其他人。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy the current drive’s sign-in information from a browser and paste it here. Do not share it with anyone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以从浏览器复制当前网盘的登录信息并粘贴到这里。不要把它发给其他人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可用 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ available"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可登录账号，或填写公开分享链接；有分享密码时一并填写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in to an account or enter a public share link. Include the share password if one is required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可登录账号，或填写公开分享链接；有分享密码时一并填写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "向服务提供商确认完整 WebDAV 地址和登录方式。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask your provider for the full WebDAV address and sign-in method."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "向服务提供商确认完整 WebDAV 地址和登录方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Kayoi 中选择发现的手机，输入手机显示的 6 位配对码。配对码过期后，请重新打开手机上的配对窗口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select the discovered phone in Kayoi and enter the 6-digit code shown on it. If the code expires, reopen the pairing window on your phone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Kayoi 中选择发现的手机，输入手机显示的 6 位配对码。配对码过期后，请重新打开手机上的配对窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 NAS 上启用 WebDAV Server 的 HTTPS 服务，并允许此账户访问目标共享。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable HTTPS in WebDAV Server on your NAS and grant this account access to the target share."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 NAS 上启用 WebDAV Server 的 HTTPS 服务，并允许此账户访问目标共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 NAS 上开启 WebDAV，并使用实际配置的端口与共享路径。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable WebDAV on your NAS and use its configured port and share path."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 NAS 上开启 WebDAV，并使用实际配置的端口与共享路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 NAS 或服务器上开启 NFS，并创建导出目录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable NFS on your NAS or server and create an exported directory."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 NAS 或服务器上开启 NFS，并创建导出目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Windows 的网络设置中开启文件和打印机共享，并给账户授予目标文件夹的访问权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on File and Printer Sharing in Windows network settings and grant the account access to the target folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Windows 的网络设置中开启文件和打印机共享，并给账户授予目标文件夹的访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Windows、Mac 或 NAS 上开启文件共享，并为要连接的文件夹设置访问权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable file sharing on Windows, Mac, or your NAS and set access permissions for the folder you want to connect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Windows、Mac 或 NAS 上开启文件共享，并为要连接的文件夹设置访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在%@网页完成登录后，从浏览器开发者工具的网络请求中复制 Cookie 请求头，再粘贴到这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After signing in on the %@ website, copy the Cookie header from a network request in your browser’s developer tools and paste it here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在%@网页完成登录后，从浏览器开发者工具的网络请求中复制 Cookie 请求头，再粘贴到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在个人设置中创建应用密码，并复制服务器提供的 WebDAV 地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create an app password in your personal settings and copy the WebDAV address supplied by the server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在个人设置中创建应用密码，并复制服务器提供的 WebDAV 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在个人设置的安全页面创建应用密码，并从文件页面复制 WebDAV 地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create an app password on the security page in your personal settings, then copy the WebDAV address from the files page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在个人设置的安全页面创建应用密码，并从文件页面复制 WebDAV 地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在位置右侧选择“重新登录”，重新完成服务商要求的授权或验证。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose “Sign In Again” on the right of the location, then complete the provider’s authorization or verification."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在位置右侧选择“重新登录”，重新完成服务商要求的授权或验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在坚果云账号的安全设置中创建应用密码，用户名填写账号邮箱。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create an app password in your Nutstore account’s security settings. Use your account email as the username."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在坚果云账号的安全设置中创建应用密码，用户名填写账号邮箱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在开发者选项中打开无线调试，再选择“使用配对码配对设备”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on Wireless Debugging in Developer Options, then choose “Pair device with pairing code”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在开发者选项中打开无线调试，再选择“使用配对码配对设备”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在手机设置中开启开发者选项和 USB 调试，再用支持数据传输的数据线连接 Mac。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable Developer Options and USB debugging in your phone’s settings, then connect it to your Mac with a cable that supports data transfer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在手机设置中开启开发者选项和 USB 调试，再用支持数据传输的数据线连接 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在手机设置中开启开发者选项，再打开 USB 调试或无线调试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on Developer Options in your phone’s settings, then enable USB debugging or Wireless Debugging."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在手机设置中开启开发者选项，再打开 USB 调试或无线调试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在服务商自己的授权页完成登录，Kayoi 只保存连接所需的登录信息。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in on the provider’s own authorization page. Kayoi saves only the information needed to connect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在服务商自己的授权页完成登录，Kayoi 只保存连接所需的登录信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在服务端允许这台 Mac 的 IP 地址访问，再填写服务器地址和完整导出路径。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow your Mac’s IP address on the server, then enter the server address and full export path."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在服务端允许这台 Mac 的 IP 地址访问，再填写服务器地址和完整导出路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在移动云盘网页完成登录后，从浏览器开发者工具的网络请求中复制 Authorization 请求头，保留 Basic 前缀或只粘贴后面的内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After signing in on the Mobile Cloud website, copy the Authorization header from a network request in your browser’s developer tools. Keep the Basic prefix or paste only the value after it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在移动云盘网页完成登录后，从浏览器开发者工具的网络请求中复制 Authorization 请求头，保留 Basic 前缀或只粘贴后面的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在系统设置中允许 Kayoi 开机自动启动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Kayoi to launch at login in System Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在系统设置中允许 Kayoi 开机自动启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在迅雷云盘网页完成登录后，从浏览器开发者工具的网络请求中复制 Authorization 请求头，保留 Token 前缀或只粘贴后面的内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After signing in on the Xunlei Drive website, copy the Authorization header from a network request in your browser’s developer tools. Keep the Token prefix or paste only the value after it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在迅雷云盘网页完成登录后，从浏览器开发者工具的网络请求中复制 Authorization 请求头，保留 Token 前缀或只粘贴后面的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填写服务地址、区域、存储桶名称、访问密钥 ID 和访问密钥。MinIO 使用自己的服务器地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the service endpoint, region, bucket name, access key ID, and secret access key. For MinIO, use your own server address."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填写服务地址、区域、存储桶名称、访问密钥 ID 和访问密钥。MinIO 使用自己的服务器地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填写电脑的 IP 地址或主机名，再填写用户名、密码和共享名。共享名不等于电脑上的完整文件路径。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the computer’s IP address or hostname, then the username, password, and share name. The share name is not the full file path on the computer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填写电脑的 IP 地址或主机名，再填写用户名、密码和共享名。共享名不等于电脑上的完整文件路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制服务商提供的完整 WebDAV 地址，保留路径，并优先使用 HTTPS。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy the full WebDAV address from your provider, including its path. Use HTTPS when available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制服务商提供的完整 WebDAV 地址，保留路径，并优先使用 HTTPS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制服务提供商给出的完整 WebDAV 地址；它通常包含文件夹路径。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy the full WebDAV address from your provider. It usually includes a folder path."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制服务提供商给出的完整 WebDAV 地址；它通常包含文件夹路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果服务商要求验证，请先在服务商页面完成验证，再回到 Kayoi 重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the provider requires verification, complete it on the provider’s page, then return to Kayoi and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果服务商要求验证，请先在服务商页面完成验证，再回到 Kayoi 重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果服务提供应用密码，请使用应用密码而不是网页登录密码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the service offers app passwords, use one instead of your web sign-in password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果服务提供应用密码，请使用应用密码而不是网页登录密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果未能识别账号，请展开“其他登录方式”，按说明复制并粘贴登录信息，再验证并保存。不要把登录信息发给其他人。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the account is not recognized, expand “Other Sign-In Methods” and follow the instructions to copy and paste your sign-in information. Then verify and save. Do not share the information with anyone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果未能识别账号，请展开“其他登录方式”，按说明复制并粘贴登录信息，再验证并保存。不要把登录信息发给其他人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果相机询问是否允许访问，请先在相机上确认，再回到 Kayoi 测试连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the camera asks to allow access, confirm on the camera before returning to Kayoi to test the connection."
